# Baseline B-28 (F-66): Date 0x44, Time 0x54, Point2D 0x58 and Duration
# 0x45 structure parameters decode to engine values whose accessors read
# back as scalars: date 2024-01-02, time 03:04:05.123456789+01:00, point
# x 1.5, duration P1Y2M3DT4H5M6.5S (14 months). Only the legacy (no utc
# patch) decoders are used, and only the record is pinned.
!: BOLT 4.4
!: AUTO HELLO
!: AUTO GOODBYE

C: RUN "RETURN $d.year AS year, $t.hour AS hour, $p.x AS x, $dur.months AS months" {"d": {"#44": [19724]}, "t": {"#54": [11045123456789, 3600]}, "p": {"#58": [7203, 1.5, 2.5]}, "dur": {"#45": [14, 3, 14706, 500000000]}} {}
   PULL {"n": -1}
S: SUCCESS {}
   RECORD [2024, 3, 1.5, 14]
   SUCCESS {}
